# Pinned Python environment of the external Parquet reader matrix (tests/readers).
# Engines that run as servers (ClickHouse, Trino) and Spark are pinned in
# docker-compose.yml / the engine runners; this file pins the in-process readers
# and the harness client libraries.
# requirements.txt is generated from this file with hashes:
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --output-file=tests/readers/requirements.txt tests/readers/requirements.in
# then install parquet-tools on top (no dependency resolution, see the note on thrift below):
#   pip install --require-hashes --no-deps -r tests/readers/requirements-parquet-tools.txt
